      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_1305_rival_05",
      "hash64": "5BB1A8D73F7016C9",
      "text": "话说，这是对战形态！\\n太强了！好酷！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_1305_botan_04",
      "hash64": "0B3CF6A82D4F2278",
      "text": "要是这么个庞然大物和人嬉闹，\\n没准真的会不妙……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_1305_rival_06",
      "hash64": "5BB1A5D73F7011B0",
      "text": "多亏了[VAR 0x0100(0000)]和\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)]的努力，\\r\\n帕底亚得救了啊。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
